Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v3.1-rc1 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains the last-minute quick fixes for the recently found
regressions, and a minor update for IDT codec driver.  Hopefully it
can be merged before you going out of WiFi-reachable area.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Andy Whitcroft (1):
      sound: oss: rename local change_bits to avoid powerpc bitsops.h definition

Dan Carpenter (1):
      ALSA: asihpi - off by one in asihpi_hpi_ioctl()

Eliot Blennerhassett (1):
      ALSA: asihpi - bug fix pa use before init.

Takashi Iwai (2):
      ALSA: hda - Fix Oops with Realtek quirks with NULL adc_nids
      ALSA: hda - Fix duplicated DAC assignments for Realtek

Vitaliy Kulikov (1):
      ALSA: hda - Add support for vref-out based mute LED control on IDT codecs

